 r←SelectMainClasses;answer;list;values;bool
 r←⍬
 ⎕←(⎕PW-1)⍴'-'
 ⎕←'Select as many main projects as you need:'
 ⎕←''
 ⎕←{((⍪'  '∘,¨2 0∘⍕¨1+⍳⍴⍵),¨⊂'.'),⍵}GetMainClasses
 ⎕←'(empty = quit)  Selecty only what you need/know. Dependcies are dealt with for you.'
 answer←⍞
 (bool values)←⎕VFI answer
 :If 0∊bool
     ⎕←'Please enter just numbers'
     →1,⍴⎕←'To continue press <enter>'
 :EndIf
 →(0∊⍴values)/0
 values←values-1
 :If ~∧/values∊⍳⍴GetMainClasses
     ⎕←'Please enter only numbers between 1 and ',⍕1+⍴GetMainClasses
     →1,⍴⎕←'To continue press <enter>'
 :EndIf
 list←'∆',¨GetMainClasses[values]
 r←∪(GetMainClasses[values]),↑,/⍎¨list
 r←GetHelpClasses,r
⍝Done
